Bundled audio recordings
------------------------
The original instrument recordings in src/recordings are CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

Sources: Versilian Studios VSCO 2 Community Edition and VCSL;
Karoryfer Samples Black and Green Guitars, Big Rusty Drums, Growlybass,
and 272 Merry Orks; FreePats FSBS Distorted Electric Guitar #2, Lately Bass,
Synth Bass #1, Synth Bass & Lead and Synth Sci-Fi; Signature Sounds
Live Children's Choir (performances 19-26).

Source licences are included in src/recordings/licenses. Exact source URLs,
pinned revisions and source/processed SHA-256 hashes are listed in
src/recordings/manifest.js. Samples have been converted to stereo 32 kHz
16-bit WAV, trimmed, level-adjusted and faded; held instruments have
crossfaded sustain loops. The rolling bass has an added short decay.

https://versilian-studios.com/vsco-community/
https://github.com/sgossner/VCSL
https://shop.karoryfer.com/pages/free-samples
https://freepats.zenvoid.org/
https://signaturesounds.org/

Additional CC0 samples: Octal House Core (octalmusic/octal-samples), and
FreePats Sweep Pad, New Age, Synth Fifths, Synth Square and Synth Calliope.
More recorded percussion and instruments from VCSL are included.
Pinned source references, source checksums, conversion/tuning details and
licence copies are retained in tools/recording-sources.json and src/recordings.

CC0 sung voices and vocal chops from Freesound: antoinevg, mooncubedesign,
ShangusBurger (GameSoundCon 2024 contributors), owstu, Legnalegna55,
.Andre_Onate and marythewitch. Public HQ MP3 previews are converted to WAV;
the female scale is sliced into five sung notes, tuning is calibrated and
sustain loops are added. Source pages and CC0 evidence are retained in
src/recordings/licenses/freesound-vocals.txt and the recording manifest.
Additional FreePats Synth Brass 1 and Synth Brass 2 samples are CC0.

Complete audio loops, phrases and ambient textures
-------------------------------------------------
Signature Sounds: Loops of Ambience, Industrial Drum Loops, Futura,
Choirs of Life (Teaser), Orchestral CC0, Basic Zither Loops and Fireplace
Foley are CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
https://signaturesounds.org/

Psytrance Loop Pack by AX11 (2010), CC BY 3.0:
https://ccmixter.org/files/AX11/27175
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/

100 BPM Rhythm Guitar Riffs by Vrezerino, CC BY 4.0:
https://freesound.org/people/Vrezerino/packs/45261/
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Public HQ MP3 previews are used for the metal riffs; other packs use original
WAV/AIFF recordings. All are converted to stereo 32 kHz 16-bit WAV and
attenuated where necessary. Full timing and releases are preserved.
Original loops are not shortened, faded or given instrument sustain loops.

Individual titles, creators, source links, licences and checksums are in
src/recordings/licenses/loop-credits.json and the recording manifest.
Source credit and licence information is included in src/recordings/licenses,
available in Sample Playground, and retained with edited samples in projects.
